// GroupProjectDemo.http

### Get all skill offers (paginated)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/v1/skilloffers?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Get a single skill offer by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/v1/skilloffers/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a new skill offer
POST https://localhost:5001/api/v1/skilloffers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Guitar Lessons",
  "description": "I can teach beginner acoustic guitar!",
  "category": "Music",
  "location": "New York"
}

### Update a skill offer
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/v1/skilloffers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Guitar Lessons",
  "description": "Now teaching intermediate and advanced players!",
  "category": "Music",
  "location": "Brooklyn"
}

### Delete a skill offer
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/v1/skilloffers/1
Accept: application/json
